    GeoTIFF: "klíče GeoTIFF", PNG: "bloky PNG", RIFF: "WebP (RIFF)", QuickTime: "ISO BMFF / QuickTime", "QuickTime:*": "stopa", C2PA: "Content Credentials: aktivní manifest a podpis", "C2PA:Assertions": "tvrzení aktivního manifestu", "C2PA:*": "další manifest nebo jeho tvrzení", JUMBF: "boxy JUMBF (ISO/IEC 19566-5)",
